SUMMARY:Omar Courtz in Concert at Toyota Center
DTSTAMP:20260824T033959Z
DTSTART:20260827T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:Toyota Center welcomes genre-bending star Omar Courtz and his P
	or Si Mañana No Estoy USA Tour to Downtown’s biggest arena. \nThe tour sup
	ports the Puerto Rican singer songwriter’s sophomore album—a streaming hit
	 with music blending R&B\, reggaeton\, Afrobeats\, and trap. \nAdmission \
	nTickets start at $61. Get tickets or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calen
	dar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boosted in our calend
	ar with images and more details. \nLearn more about promoting your event\,
	 organization\, business\, or offer across all of our channels. \n\nhttps:
	//365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/omar-courtz-in-concert-at-toyota-center/
	\n\nFrom 365 Things to Do in Houston
