	ov for 6 shows over 3 nights on the Spring Branch stage. \nPeters was rece
	ntly named as one of Rolling Stone’s 50 Best Comics of All Time. \nHe star
	ted doing stand-up at the age of 19 at open mics in his native Toronto\, a
	nd spent the next 15 years honing his craft at clubs across Canada and the
	 UK. \nAdmission\nTickets start at $68. Order tickets or learn more. \n \n
	\nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and 
